# policy/protected.paths — read-only / maintenance-only paths (the rails).
# Read by tools/pretooluse-guard.sh: Edit/Write to these, or shell mutation of them, is DENIED
# unless AGENT_LAB_MAINTENANCE=1 (an explicit, separately-approved maintenance task).
# AGENTS.md defines maintenance authority. Entries ending in / are directory prefixes; others are file paths.
# Paths are matched anywhere in the string (absolute or repo-relative), at a / boundary.

